modal.db_maint.help.objects_no_wp.steps:
With the check query, check names and APPs of the objects.
If none is needed, delete them all together; otherwise one at a time, keeping those to recover.
To recover one, move it to an existing WP: UPDATE objects SET wp_id = <WP_ID> WHERE obj_id = <ID>;

